				"text": "How does *checkout* work?"
			},
			{
				"id": "l1",
				"who": "lead",
				"t": 1.9,
				"text": "Just ask *Dave*.",
				"seed": 3
			},
			{
				"id": "n2",
				"t": 3.15,
				"text": "Dave left in *March*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n3",
				"t": 5,
				"text": "So I asked *around*."
			},
			{
				"id": "l2",
				"who": "pm",
				"t": 6.3,
				"text": "Dave *knows*."
			},
			{
				"id": "l3",
				"who": "intern",
				"t": 7.6,
				"text": "I was going to ask *Dave*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n4",
				"t": 9.6,
				"text": "The wiki just says: *see Dave*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n5",
				"t": 12.1,
				"text": "His auto-reply? For checkout questions, *ask Dave*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n6",
				"t": 15.6,
				"text": "The only thing he left behind: one sticky note."
			},
			{
				"id": "n7",
				"t": 18.3,
				"text": "It says: *it's complicated*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n8",
				"t": 20.7,
				"text": "Our architecture had one load-bearing *Dave*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n9",
				"t": 23.7,
				"seed": 11,
				"text": "So I opened the *endpoint* in Insilode.",
				"say": "So I opened the endpoint in Insihlode."
			},
			{
				"id": "n10",
				"t": 26,
				"text": "It draws how the request actually *runs*."
			},
			{
				"id": "n11",
				"t": 28.8,
				"text": "The controller. The service. The *orders* table."
			},
			{
				"id": "n12",
				"t": 32.4,
				"text": "Over HTTP into *billing*. Over Kafka into shipping.",
				"say": "Over H T T P into billing. Over Kafka into shipping."
			},
			{
				"id": "n13",
				"t": 37.2,
				"text": "Dave left in March. The code *didn't*.",
				"seed": 13
			},
			{
				"id": "n14",
				"t": 39.9,
				"text": "Dave's still in *there*."
