	"description": "How does checkout work? Ask Dave. Dave left in March. A new hire asks around, finds a farewell card, a wiki page that says see Dave, an auto-reply that says ask Dave and one sticky note, then opens the endpoint in Insilode and sees how the request actually runs: controller, service, the orders table, HTTP into billing, Kafka into shipping. Demo project (Harbor Goods). Real captures of Insilode, a code editor built on VS Code. Voice: synthetic (AI-generated). Music composed in code. Free and open source: insilode.dev",
